"Because all the accumulations of realization are not realized as the nature "
"of phenomena,"

msgctxt "98df0e050a2b4ebd8c96d25d106c4cb2"
msgid "དབང་ གསུམ་པ་␣འི་ དགོས་པ་ སྟོང་ ཞིང་"
msgstr "The purpose of the third empowerment becomes empty and "

msgctxt "f9ecd23f60ca4399a167694505fcc1d7"
msgid "མདོ་སྔགས་ ཀྱི་ རྩ་ལྟུང་ བསྒྲུབ་པ་␣ར་ འགྱུར་བ་␣འི་ ཕྱིར་ རོ ། །"
