msgctxt "86554463cbfc47619e623e84a9d6b820"
msgid "བཀག་པ་ ཡེ་ བཀག་ ཡིན་པ་␣ས་ ཀྱང༌ །"
msgstr "The prohibitions are primordial prohibitions,"

msgctxt "e9c38b4fb08f4f39963a46d0f28dbdf5"
