msgstr "If that which is not is established as it is by imputation,"

msgctxt "9a2c78db020445c4962daa705f3f33ab"
msgid "ཕྱི་རོལ་པ་␣ས་ ཀྱང་ གནས་ལུགས་ རྟོགས་པ་␣ར་ ཐལ །"
msgstr "then it follows that even non-Buddhists realize the actuality."

msgctxt "ed80a84001f74e36bf978eeb36c56b32"
